{"content":"{\n  \"chapter_contract_id\": \"contract:v2-n-3-3-1:v2\",\n  \"node_id\": \"v2_n_3_3_1\",\n  \"schema_version\": \"ordered_chapter_draft_candidate.v1\",\n  \"known_evidence_ids\": [],\n  \"blocks\": [\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"blk:v2_n_3_3_1:001\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"本试验的安全性目的是评价合成药X 150 mg皮下给药方案相较安慰剂在成人慢性鼻窦炎伴鼻息肉患者中的安全性和耐受性。安全性终点包括不良事件（AE=不良事件）发生率、严重不良事件（SAE=严重不良事件）发生率及注射部位反应发生率。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"blk:v2_n_3_3_1:002\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"安全性观察期应覆盖整个研究期间，包括治疗期和安全性随访期。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"blk:v2_n_3_3_1:003\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"给药途径为皮下注射，注射反应适用性判定为适用，理由为研究药物为皮下注射给药，需评估注射部位反应。注射部位反应指皮下注射后发生于注射部位的局部不良事件，按美国国家癌症研究所不良事件通用术语标准（NCI CTCAE）5.0版进行严重程度分级，并按预先定义的类别记录和汇总。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    }\n  ]\n}","receipt":{"idempotency_key":"chapter-draft.generate.v1","input_artifacts":[{"ref":"chapter-intake","sha256":"2a1c481229e7d13302a1a8596ecb5d218e341a1b5d40b93e4b62fa37d59be236"}],"logical_call_id":"call:chapter-draft:48c475ecc62e3134193aedb66c21c793b4a09fbad8d09e96878511c4841762c4:chapter-generate","node_execution_contract_id":"nec:chapter-draft:48c475ecc62e3134193aedb66c21c793b4a09fbad8d09e96878511c4841762c4:chapter-generate","observed_model":"deepseek-flash","observed_provider":"deepseek","output_schema_ref":"https://protocol-v3.local/schemas/ordered-chapter-draft-candidate.v1.json","output_sha256":"d0d12ae64a085d7dc896a62f43642e110c0b1226661f599485182e85be7d68de","prompt_sha256":"9aec0ea7a8d8361fdb1c273790e20e30d5e6b1d7680ac1c6c63436bd71300fac","provider_session_id":"4e95e8f9-76c4-42fe-8b35-e88c12b6c0b7","requested_reasoning_effort":"max"},"schema":"model_response.v1"}